# AOT compile artifacts. `.lib` and `.rtsdata` are here because `rts compile`
# leaves an import library and a data sidecar beside the binary, and the CI
# smoke test writes both into the repository root — one of them was committed by
# accident before this line existed.
*.obj
*.m
*.lib
*.rtsdata
smoke_aot
smoke_aot.exe
# The second AOT smoke: the one that diffs `rts compile`'s answer against
# `rts run`'s, over a module graph.
smoke_graph
smoke_graph.exe
jit.txt
aot.txt

